-- Data: Collection of Row data
-- Database: Origanize collection of Data.
-- Data Management System: It is sytem or Software that manage the data in CRUD(Create, Read, Update, Delete) system.

-- Types of Data: Structure, Semi-Structured, Unstructured
	-- Structured data: Tables, 2D data
	-- Semi-structured: .json, .xml, .yml (Key- Value)
	-- Unstructured data: Video, images, etc.
-- Data ---> Database ---> DBMS
-- Data Model: Data Schema/blueprint (logical structure - how data stored in Database)
	-- Data models are Hierarchy model, Relational model(Tabel), Netwrok model, NoSql model(Mongo DB).
